    "physical_description": "Bag face\r\n\r\nWARP:  cream wool; Z2S; 21 threads per inch (83 per dm).\r\n\r\nWEFT: brown wool; Z spun, unplied; 2 shoots after every row of knots; 24 knots per inch (96 per dm).\r\n\r\nPILE: wool and silk; 7 colours: dark red, red, green, dark blue, pink (silk), brown, cream , asymmetrical knot open to the right and tied around 2 threads, although there are areas of jufti knotting; 252 knots per sq. inch (3984 per sq. dm).\r\n\r\nSIDE FINISH: 2 cords overcast with red wool.\r\n\r\nEND FINISH: Lower: 1.5 cms. of plain weave with cream weft remains with a row of multi-coloured jufti knots which would have formed a fringe.  Upper: 5 cms. plain weave remains, with red weft and then cream weft; turned under and stitched in place.\r\n\r\nDESIGN: field: dark red ground with three vertical rows of three guls and two vertical rows of two complete stars.\r\n\r\nMain border: horned rectangles containing two colour rosettes.\r\n\r\nLower band: undecorated red pile.\r\n\r\nUpper band: band of red pile divided horizontally by two narrow bands of green and red knots.\r\n\r\nCatalogue date: 28.6.94",
